@startuml EquipmentAvailability
!include style.puml
!pragma layout smetana
top to bottom direction
hide empty description

state Available
state Loaned
state Unserviceable

[*] --> Available : add equipment
Available --> Loaned : loan saved or reassigned\n/ attach equipment
Loaned --> Available : serviceable return saved,\nloan deleted or reassigned\n/ release equipment
Loaned --> Unserviceable : unserviceable return saved\n/ release equipment
@enduml
